    "html_wkbYP9": {
      "type": "html",
      "name": "HTML",
      "settings": {
        "html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>O que é o Women Forward?</title>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #fff;}\n  </style>\n\n\n  <section class=\"w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-14\">\n    <!-- Título e Descrição -->\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-10\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#18191F] mb-4\">\n        O que é o <span class=\"text-[#f36c21]\">Women Forward?</span>\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-lg text-[#3d3f43] max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n        Uma imersão cocriada por <span class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F]\">Hyper Island</span> e <span class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F]\">LinkedIn</span> para impulsionar mulheres que lideram — ou querem liderar — com mais coragem, autenticidade e impacto.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <!-- Grid Principal -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-10 md:gap-16 mb-12\">\n      <!-- Coluna esquerda -->\n      <div class=\"flex-1\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <span class=\"text-2xl md:text-xl font-bold text-[#18191F]\">Não é um curso. É uma <span class=\"text-[#f36c21]\">pausa estratégica.</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-base text-[#5B5D63] mb-7 max-w-lg\">\n          Um espaço seguro para se ouvir, se desafiar e se transformar. Durante 3 dias intensivos, você terá a oportunidade de se reconectar com sua essência e descobrir novas perspectivas sobre liderança feminina.\n        </p>\n        <!-- Lista de benefícios -->\n        <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n          <!-- Item 1 -->\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"mt-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-6 w-6 text-[#f36c21] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-1\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#fff3e6\"></circle>\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F]\">Reconectar-se com sua essência</span><br>\n              <span class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">Redescubra seus valores e propósito de liderança</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <!-- Item 2 -->\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"mt-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-6 w-6 text-[#f36c21] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-1\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#fff3e6\"></circle>\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l2 2\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F]\">Desenvolver habilidades essenciais</span><br>\n              <span class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">Para um mundo em constante mudança</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <!-- Item 3 -->\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"mt-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-6 w-6 text-[#f36c21] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-1\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#fff3e6\"></circle>\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l-5 8-3-4\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F]\">Fortalecer uma rede de mulheres</span><br>\n              <span class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">Conexões poderosas com propósito</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <!-- Item 4 -->\n          <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"mt-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-6 w-6 text-[#f36c21] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-1\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#fff3e6\"></circle>\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12h6m-3-3v6\"></path>\n              </svg>\n            </span>\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F]\">Sair com clareza</span><br>\n              <span class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">Sobre seus próximos passos profissionais</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Coluna direita: Imagem -->\n      <div class=\"flex-1 flex justify-center\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/humancentric2.jpg?v=1695926926\" alt=\"Women Forward\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-xl w-full max-w-md object-cover h-[280px] md:h-[320px]\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- Card: Quem estará lá -->\n    <div class=\"w-full rounded-2xl bg-[#fff3e6] p-8 md:p-10 shadow flex flex-col items-center\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#18191F] mb-2 text-center\">Quem estará lá?</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-base text-[#3d3f43] mb-6 text-center max-w-2xl\">\n        Mulheres em posições de liderança ou prontas para dar o próximo passo. Um grupo diverso de executivas que querem crescer — e crescer juntas.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 w-full max-w-4xl\">\n        <!-- Executivas -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl py-6 px-4 text-center shadow border border-[#f8e3ce]\">\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-[#18191F] mb-1\">Executivas</div>\n          <div class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">De grandes empresas nacionais e multinacionais</div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Empreendedoras -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl py-6 px-4 text-center shadow border border-[#f8e3ce]\">\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-[#18191F] mb-1\">Empreendedoras</div>\n          <div class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">De impacto e startups de alta performance</div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Líderes de RH -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl py-6 px-4 text-center shadow border border-[#f8e3ce]\">\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-[#18191F] mb-1\">Líderes de RH</div>\n          <div class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">E profissionais de People &amp; Culture</div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Inovadoras -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl py-6 px-4 text-center shadow border border-[#f8e3ce]\">\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-[#18191F] mb-1\">Inovadoras</div>\n          <div class=\"text-sm text-[#5B5D63]\">Em comunicação e transformação digital</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
