        "html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Programa da Imersão</title>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #fafbfc;}\n  </style>\n\n\n  <section class=\"w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto px-2 md:px-0 pt-14 pb-6\">\n    <!-- Título -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#18191F] text-center mb-2\">\n      Programa da <span class=\"text-[#f36c21]\">Imersão</span>\n    </h2>\n    <p class=\"text-lg text-[#5B5D63] text-center mb-12\">\n      Três dias intensivos desenhados para transformar sua liderança e ampliar suas conexões\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- Cards dos dias -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-7\">\n\n      <!-- DIA 1 -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow bg-white\">\n        <!-- Esquerda: Gradiente -->\n        <div class=\"w-full md:w-[38%] p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fa892c] to-[#f05b3c] text-white flex flex-col justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n              <span>\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-7 w-7 opacity-80\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"#fff\" fill=\"none\"></circle>\n                  <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l2 2\" stroke=\"#fff\"></path>\n                </svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"uppercase font-bold text-base tracking-wide\">DIA 1</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Liderar de Dentro para Fora</div>\n            <div class=\"font-semibold mb-3 text-lg\">Autoliderança e Autenticidade</div>\n            <div class=\"text-base mb-7 text-white/90\">\n              Explore como cultivar uma liderança enraizada em autoconhecimento e autenticidade. Identifique seus valores, forças e pontos de tensão.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-medium opacity-90\">\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 inline\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 7V3M16 7V3M4 11h16M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2v-7H3v7a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path>\n              </svg>\n              09:00 - 17:00\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 inline\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M16 8c0-2.21-3.582-4-8-4S0 5.79 0 8v8c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V8z\" transform=\"translate(4 4)\"></path>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n              </svg>\n              Presencial\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Direita: Conteúdo -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F] text-lg mb-4\">Você vai trabalhar:</div>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#fa892c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Autoliderança em contextos de alta pressão\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#fa892c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Polaridades femininas no ambiente corporativo\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#fa892c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Práticas de autoconsciência e regulação emocional\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#fa892c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Crenças que fortalecem sua presença de liderança\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-xl p-4 text-[#18191F] text-base\">\n              <span class=\"font-semibold\">Como o dia termina:</span> <br>\n              Rituais de reconexão e histórias de coragem compartilhadas\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- DIA 2 -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow bg-white\">\n        <!-- Esquerda: Gradiente -->\n        <div class=\"w-full md:w-[38%] p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fa892c] via-[#f05b3c] to-[#d94e99] text-white flex flex-col justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n              <span>\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-7 w-7 opacity-80\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"#fff\" fill=\"none\"></circle>\n                  <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l2 2\" stroke=\"#fff\"></path>\n                </svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"uppercase font-bold text-base tracking-wide\">DIA 2</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Inspiração e Comunicação</div>\n            <div class=\"font-semibold mb-3 text-lg\">Influência e Impacto</div>\n            <div class=\"text-base mb-7 text-white/90\">\n              Desenvolva habilidades para inspirar equipes e comunicar com impacto. Aprenda a navegar conversas difíceis e liderar mudanças.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-medium opacity-90\">\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 inline\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 7V3M16 7V3M4 11h16M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2v-7H3v7a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path>\n              </svg>\n              09:00 - 17:00\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 inline\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M16 8c0-2.21-3.582-4-8-4S0 5.79 0 8v8c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V8z\" transform=\"translate(4 4)\"></path>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n              </svg>\n              Presencial\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Direita: Conteúdo -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F] text-lg mb-4\">Você vai trabalhar:</div>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#f05b3c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Comunicação assertiva e persuasiva\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#f05b3c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Storytelling para liderança\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#f05b3c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Gestão de conflitos e conversas difíceis\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#f05b3c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Influência sem autoridade formal\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-xl p-4 text-[#18191F] text-base\">\n              <span class=\"font-semibold\">Como o dia termina:</span> <br>\n              Conversa franca com convidadas inspiradoras e jantar de celebração\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- DIA 3 -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow bg-white\">\n        <!-- Esquerda: Gradiente -->\n        <div class=\"w-full md:w-[38%] p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fa892c] via-[#f05b3c] to-[#d94e99] text-white flex flex-col justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n              <span>\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-7 w-7 opacity-80\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                  <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"#fff\" fill=\"none\"></circle>\n                  <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l2 2\" stroke=\"#fff\"></path>\n                </svg>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"uppercase font-bold text-base tracking-wide\">DIA 3</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Conexões e Futuro</div>\n            <div class=\"font-semibold mb-3 text-lg\">Rede e Próximos Passos</div>\n            <div class=\"text-base mb-7 text-white/90\">\n              Construa uma rede sólida de mulheres líderes e defina seu plano de ação para os próximos desafios profissionais.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-medium opacity-90\">\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 inline\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 7V3M16 7V3M4 11h16M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2v-7H3v7a2 2 0 002 2z\"></path>\n              </svg>\n              09:00 - 17:00\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 inline\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M16 8c0-2.21-3.582-4-8-4S0 5.79 0 8v8c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V8z\" transform=\"translate(4 4)\"></path>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n              </svg>\n              Presencial\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Direita: Conteúdo -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"font-bold text-[#18191F] text-lg mb-4\">Você vai trabalhar:</div>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#eea51c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Networking estratégico e autêntico\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#eea51c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Mentoria e sponsorship\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#eea51c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Planejamento de carreira e sucessão\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                <span>\n                  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#eea51c] bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-full p-[2px]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n                    <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M8 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                Construindo um legado de liderança\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-xl p-4 text-[#18191F] text-base\">\n              <span class=\"font-semibold\">Como o dia termina:</span> <br>\n              Ritual coletivo de compromisso com o futuro que queremos construir\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- METODOLOGIA HYPER ISLAND -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-12 mb-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-[#cd520e] rounded-2xl px-8 py-10 md:py-11 flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n        <div class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Metodologia Hyper Island</div>\n        <p class=\"text-white/90 text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl mb-5\">\n          Experiencial, colaborativa e desenhada para o mundo real. Mais de 28 anos desenvolvendo líderes e organizações em todo o mundo.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center text-white font-medium text-base\">\n          <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 20h5v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M9 20h6M4 20h5M9 11a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM21 11a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            Aprendizagem entre pares\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 12H9\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            Foco em aplicabilidade\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12h6m-3-3v6\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            Experiência transformadora\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
