      "settings": {
        "html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Garanta sua vaga</title>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #fafbfc;}\n    .hs-form-frame input, .hs-form-frame select, .hs-form-frame textarea {\n      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      border-radius: 0.5rem;\n      border: 1.5px solid #DFE3E8;\n      background: #fff;\n      padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n      outline: none;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    .hs-form-frame label {\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      color: #18191F;\n    }\n    .hs-form-frame button,\n    .hs-form-frame input[type=\"submit\"] {\n      background: #f36c21 !important;\n      color: #fff !important;\n      font-weight: bold !important;\n      border-radius: 0.75rem !important;\n      padding: 1rem 0 !important;\n      font-size: 1.13rem !important;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px 0 #f36c2133;\n      margin-top: 1rem;\n    }\n  </style>\n  <!-- Hubspot embed abaixo (requer internet ativa para renderização real) -->\n  <script src=\"https://js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/1588780.js\" defer></script>\n\n\n  <section class=\"w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12 pb-14\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-center text-[#18191F] mb-1\">Garanta sua <span class=\"text-[#f36c21]\">vaga</span>\n</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-[#5B5D63] text-center text-base md:text-lg mb-10\">Vagas limitadas para garantir a qualidade das conexões e experiência personalizada</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 mb-8\">\n      <!-- Esquerda: Informações -->\n      <div class=\"w-full md:w-[40%] flex flex-col gap-5\">\n        <!-- Card Infos -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-7\">\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-[#18191F] mb-4\">Informações do Investimento</div>\n          <div class=\"bg-[#fff3e6] rounded-lg px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between mb-4\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"text-xs text-[#f36c21] font-medium mb-1\">Early Bird até 31 de Julho</div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-[#f36c21] font-bold text-2xl\">R$ 15.291</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[#aaa] line-through text-base\">R$ 17.999</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#f36c21] text-sm font-semibold\">15% OFF</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[#a3653b] text-xs\">Últimos dias</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-3 text-[#18191F] text-base\">\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#2dcc85]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#e8f6ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> 3 dias de imersão completa</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#2dcc85]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#e8f6ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Hospedagem no Club Med</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#2dcc85]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#e8f6ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Todas as refeições inclusas</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#2dcc85]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#e8f6ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Material de apoio completo</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#2dcc85]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#e8f6ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Certificado de participação</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#2dcc85]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#e8f6ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Acesso ao grupo exclusivo</li>\n          </ul>\n          <hr class=\"my-3 border-[#DFE3E8]\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 mb-2\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#f36c21]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n              <rect x=\"5\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#f36c21\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#fff3e6\"></rect>\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 10l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"text-[#f36c21] font-semibold\">Parcelamento disponível</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-[#18191F] text-sm mb-1 ml-7\">Até 6x sem juros no cartão de crédito<br>Desconto para pagamento à vista</div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#2dcc85] text-sm font-medium ml-7\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#e8f6ed\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>\n            Garantia de 7 dias para cancelamento\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Card Desconto Corporativo -->\n        <div class=\"bg-[#f36c21] rounded-2xl px-6 py-7 text-white mt-2 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-1\">Desconto Corporativo</div>\n          <div class=\"text-base\">Sua empresa pode patrocinar sua participação ou enviar múltiplas executivas com desconto progressivo.</div>\n          <ul class=\"text-base font-medium mb-3\">\n            <li>- 2 vagas: <span class=\"font-bold\">5% de desconto</span>\n</li>\n            <li>- 3+ vagas: <span class=\"font-bold\">10% de desconto</span>\n</li>\n            <li>- 5+ vagas: <span class=\"font-bold\">15% de desconto</span>\n</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-white text-[#f36c21] rounded-xl font-bold py-3 px-4 w-fit mt-2 hover:bg-[#fff3e6] hover:text-[#e06622] transition\">Falar com consultor</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Direita: Formulário -->\n      <div class=\"w-full md:w-[60%]\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow p-7\">\n          <div class=\"font-bold text-lg text-[#18191F] mb-4\">Inscreva-se agora</div>\n          <!-- Formulário Hubspot Embed -->\n          <div class=\"mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"hs-form-frame\" data-region=\"na1\" data-form-id=\"3bacda62-0461-44de-b2f9-d3eef2f0c94d\" data-portal-id=\"1588780\"></div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#5B5D63] text-sm mt-3\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-[#f36c21]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m7-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            Processamento em até 24 horas\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#5B5D63] text-sm mt-1\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-[#2dcc85]\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m7-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            Dúvidas? WhatsApp: (11) 99999-9999\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
